A1. Sweet nothings of love. ~ MUSH
A5. A girl is usually willing to give this up for a husband. ~ LOVER
A10. Altho no Confederate he bitterly fought the Union. ~ SCAB
A14. Repeat this and you double it. ~ ONCE
A15. To be of the mind that. ~ OPINE
A16. My Lord. ~ EARL
