A18. A bear of an undergarment. ~ TEDDY
A19. A self-starter. ~ URGE
A20. These are great mud slingers. ~ ETNAS
A22. The name of a name of a thing (pl.). ~ NOUNS
A24. This is hardly a laughing matter. ~ PUS
A25. This made a famous stage character out of a Ham. ~ LET
A26. The Army's color on a Blue Monday (abbr.). ~ OD
A28. Polite term for boarding house grab. ~ REACH
A30. This moves even the hardest-boiled sailor (abbr.). ~ SS
A31. Automatic rejector (abbr.). ~ ED
