D1. When Edison did this it was an example for imitation. ~ MODELED
D2. What he did to make ends meet. ~ UNITED
D3. The kind of apparel they wear for Ziegfeld. ~ SCANT
D4. Norse goddess whose name sounds like a terrible place. ~ HELA
D5. He never used salt without thinking of his wife. ~ LOT
D6. If your friends give a rap for you you'll do this for them. ~ OPEN
D7. A Hollywood King. ~ VIDOR
D8. Even Mrs. Grundy would concede this as being fully clothed. ~ ENDUED
