D10. It takes this to get Seuss, the mad doctor, started. ~ SEU
D11. This is rather fishy. ~ CARP
D12. The giant with the hundred eyes. ~ ARGUS
D13. Hats off, men! Here's what a good woman does to a man's life. ~ BLESSES
